{'symbol': 'DE', 'date': '2023-05-24 11:58:00', 'title': 'JOHN DEERE RECOGNIZED AS ONE OF THE 50 MOST COMMUNITY-MINDED COMPANIES IN THE UNITED STATES IN 2023', 'text': 'MOLINE, ILL. , MAY 24, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0FOR THE SECOND YEAR IN A ROW, JOHN DEERE (NYSE: DE) HAS BEEN NAMED AN HONOREE OF THE CIVIC 50, WHICH RECOGNIZES THE 50 MOST COMMUNITY-MINDED COMPANIES IN THE NATION EACH YEAR ACCORDING TO AN ANNUAL SURVEY.'}